{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive, maintain, explore, scavenge and hunt to survive the Long Drive North.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive and maintain your trusty old RV: get hands on and refuel &amp; repair your vehicle </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive an unforgiving world: manage your sleep, hunger and thirst levels, scavenge for parts, and hunt for food </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use recipes and cook to survive </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the wilderness: discover a post-disaster American wilderness, an open world, sandbox environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or in up to 4 player co-op multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the frontier on-foot and behind the wheel. Can you conquer the wilderness and survive your desperate journey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long Drive North is inspired by the likes of <i>The Long Dark</i>, <i>The Long Drive</i> and <i>My Summer Car</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179350/extras/aa508930a944ef1c1be35fd6fc89dc66.poster.avif?t=1759419978\" aria-label=\"A short, looping video showing driving an RV through a snowy environment in 1st person with smoke rising from the bonnet. The smoking engine parts under the hood are then shown.\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179350/extras/aa508930a944ef1c1be35fd6fc89dc66.webm?t=1759419978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179350/extras/aa508930a944ef1c1be35fd6fc89dc66.mp4?t=1759419978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your RV may be old and a little worn out, but it\u2019s still a reliable vehicle. The motorhome will provide you with refuge, so you\u2019ll need to give it a little loving maintenance in return. Get your hands dirty and get under the hood to repair and refuel your RV in this automobile simulator. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure your vehicle is up to the job by upgrading various components and parts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179350/extras/10fb37b007d0e8499097467296854d95.poster.avif?t=1759419978\" aria-label=\"A clip of 1st person hunting. The player character&#039;s arm and a rifle can be seen, as the player approaches a watchtower. Then the video cuts to showing a deer and the character shoots.\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179350/extras/10fb37b007d0e8499097467296854d95.webm?t=1759419978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179350/extras/10fb37b007d0e8499097467296854d95.mp4?t=1759419978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a long way from home, lost in unfamiliar, dangerous territory. Scavenge for parts from abandoned cars and decrepit buildings. Equip your hunting rifle and go hunting with your dog companion \u2013 get crafty with recipes and cook food to survive your road trip. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage sleep, hunger and thirst levels to survive a desperate and brutal journey through an unforgiving, harsh environment. Face the elements and keep an eye out to avoid a dangerous recurring storm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179350/extras/15e3ef37de3226cfbef05bd28f1fc00b.poster.avif?t=1759419978\" aria-label=\"A video showing multiple RVs driving along a road in a convoy in a snowy American wilderness environment. The video then cuts to show four RVs parked up on an overlook, with a campfire lit nearby.\" width=780 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179350/extras/15e3ef37de3226cfbef05bd28f1fc00b.webm?t=1759419978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179350/extras/15e3ef37de3226cfbef05bd28f1fc00b.mp4?t=1759419978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the frontier on foot and behind the wheel. Navigate post-disaster American wilderness and discover what awaits in this open world, sandbox environment.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3179350?t=1759419978","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3179350?t=1759419978","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179350/8af552c06fd9356742f3879276bf8d82931a0543/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759419978","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179350/8af552c06fd9356742f3879276bf8d82931a0543/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759419978","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4024830,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive, maintain, explore, scavenge and hunt to survive the Long Drive North.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=