ican wilderness environment. The video then cuts to show four RVs parked up on an overlook, with a campfire lit nearby.\" width=780 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179350/extras/15e3ef37de3226cfbef05bd28f1fc00b.webm?t=1759419978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179350/extras/15e3ef37de3226cfbef05bd28f1fc00b.mp4?t=1759419978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the frontier on foot and behind the wheel. Navigate post-disaster American wilderness and discover what awaits in this open world, sandbox environment.</p>","developers":["Mindflair Games LTD"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179350/header.jpg?t=1759419978","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Excalibur Publishing \u00a9 2024 - All rights reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3179350/186311159/42e7187fb9cb9f2e20006c5adaaa1786e7e8dcd0/1755251374/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755252862","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3179350/186311159/42e7187fb9cb9f2e20006c5adaaa1786e7e8dcd0/1755251374/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755252862","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3179350/186311159/42e7187fb9cb9f2e20006c5adaaa1786e7e8dcd0/1755251374/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755252862","id":257054464,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257054464/movie480.mp4?t=1755252862","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257054464/movie_max.mp4?t=1755252862"},"name":"Long Drive North Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257054464/83a5a4b5f4df732323a248410